        },
        "text_p4dVnU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kiwi Cru is about bringing you great wines, made by outstanding people who are committed to sustainability and to leaving the planet better than they found it. </p><p></p><p>And the impressive thing is that’s not such a tall order when it comes to New Zealand. They have put sustainability at the heart of what they do for decades now. In fact, the industry implemented a Sustainable Winegrowing certification programme as long ago as 1995. </p><p>And today, New Zealand is a <em><strong>global leader</strong></em> in low intervention wine making. </p>",
            "highlight_style": "none"
          }
        }
