    "custom_content_ccYVFU": {
      "type": "custom-content",
      "blocks": {
        "text_B8UVnN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "title": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Packaging with Purpose</span></h2><p>When you receive a Kiwi Cru delivery, you’ll find the box is brown cardboard (non-coloured boxes require fewer chemicals to make). It’s made from recycled material and uses soy-based ink for our logo. </p><p>Sealed with a gummed paper-water activated tape, which is the only tape on the market that is 100% recyclable, biodegradable and manufactured from renewable materials.</p><p>Once you’ve opened it, you’ll see that the packaging is also made from 100% recycled materials, called <a href=\"https://egipulp.com/6-bottle/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://egipulp.com/6-bottle/\"><strong>PulpSafe</strong></a><strong>.</strong> It’s light (so easier to transport), and like the box, it’s completely recyclable. We also like it because it’s really effective at minimising breakages, which means there’s less transportation and packaging necessary as a result.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "center",
            "padding_left": 0,
            "padding_right": 0,
            "align_content_container": "none",
            "button_label": "",
